        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Part of a vertical repeat. On a figured white warp twill ground, a symmetrical design showing a large green and yellow fruit-flower from which issue, at left and right, rose colored, violet and blue roses, yellow and green foliage and yellow berries. Narrow, flat selvedges. Several small stains."@en ;
